D.C..

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:23.180
Democrats and normal people want to investigate
January 6th because it was an absolute disgrace.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.600
It was an outrageous, tragic moment in American
history.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.640
And there are almost endless avenues of investigation
that should be pursued.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:34.480
Who all participated, who was responsible,
who instigated.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.649
What are the full explanations for delays
in getting National Guard and more police

00:00:38.649 --> 00:00:40.000
