00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.590
But there are endless avenues of questions
which I would love to see answered.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:52.050
And yet Republicans sent out a letter.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:56.089
Republican leaders sent out a letter to Republican
members of Congress yesterday trying to convince

00:00:56.089 --> 00:01:01.379
