00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:09.210
House Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy, a disgusting
person, came out against the bipartisan deal,

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.800
saying the scope of the investigation is too
narrow.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.800
Now, this is really is the it's not shrewd
because shrewd almost has like a positive

