00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.680
That sounds good, right?

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:32.680
Wrong.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.640
Republicans say in their letter that to really
investigate what happened on January 6th,

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:42.170
